{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d3ec206f-86aa-8ab2-8433-8191079598ba",
  "created_at": "2026-01-05T09:24:10-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Conceicao Amaral",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:20:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:20:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Tony. My name is Conceicao Amaral. I am calling about my water and sewer bill. I have two or three questions, if that is okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:20:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go right ahead. What can I help you with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:20:20-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "First, I want to change the mailing address. I am renting, and the bill goes to the old place where I lived before. And I want to stop the paper and go paperless, if I can do this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:20:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, we can do that. Can you give me the account number or the name on the account so I can pull it up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:20:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The name is Amaral, A-M-A-R-A-L. Conceicao is C-O-N-C-E-I-C-A-O. I do not have the account number in front of me, it is in the other paper. [pause]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:20:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right, the name works. Let me look. I've got an Amaral here. Can you confirm the service address for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:21:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, I would rather not say the address on the phone. Is there another way? I can tell you the phone number on the account."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:21:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead with the phone number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:21:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-eight-five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:21:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, that matches. Okay, so what's the new mailing address you want on there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:21:24-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will send it to you in writing, I think. Today I only want to know how to do it. And the paperless, is it by email?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:21:34-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, paperless is by email. You'd sign up with an email address and the bill comes there instead of in the mail. For the mailing address, you can send us a note with the account name and the new address, or I can take it by phone once you have it handy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:21:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. [pause] I think there is a little noise on the line, a hum. Can you hear it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:22:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little bit, yeah, a faint hum. I can still hear you fine, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:22:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, good. Second question. On the bill it says the word consumption. I do not understand this word. What is consumption?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:22:15-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Consumption is just how much water you used during the billing period. It's measured by the meter, so that number is the amount of water that came through, and the charge is based on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:22:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it is not a, how do you say, a fee for something else. It is only the water I use."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:22:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, it's the usage. There can be other charges on the bill too, like the sewer part, but consumption itself is the amount used."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:22:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Now I understand better. Thank you. [line breaks up] Sorry, the hum, it goes and comes back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:22:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I've got you. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:22:56-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the last one. I work during the week, so I want to know about paying outside the regular hours. Can the payments be made on a Saturday or Sunday? Maybe online, or some other way?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:23:09-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Online payment is available any day, weekends included, so you can pay Saturday or Sunday from your phone or computer. City Hall itself is closed on weekends, but there's also a drop box you can use for a check any time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:23:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A drop box. Okay. And online, the payment goes in the same day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:23:30-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It usually posts within a day or so, so I'd pay a little ahead of the due date rather than the last minute."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:23:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I will do this. So, to finish, I send you the new address in writing, and I sign up for paperless with an email."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:23:49-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Or call back when you have the new address and we'll update it over the phone. Either works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:23:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. I will call back, I think, it is faster. Thank you very much, Tony. You were very clear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:24:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My pleasure. Have a good Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T09:24:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
